[ti:Lot 001 Tanpura Snap]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ank se jab hui shuruaat..
[00:15.19]kisne aisa suchaa thaa..
[00:22.38]aksharon ka bik jaanaa..
[00:29.58]ye sabse badaa dhokaa thaa..
[00:36.77]Dhaatu jab tak dhwani adhaarita...
[00:43.96]manavtaa hui kitni mahaan..
[00:51.15]sanJnaa ke jaalon mein phans gaye..
[00:58.34]sabko bandhe ek hi naam..
[01:05.53]Lagaa baazaar jane kyaa kyaa bikega aaj..
[01:12.72]aray is bikaawali main jaane kitne chhupe hain raaj..
[01:19.92]Bik raha hai 'Brahmi' ka woh pehla sanskaar,
[01:27.11]QR code mein simat gaya hai sadiyon ka vichaar.
[02:03.07]Sarvnaam jab raas naa aaye.. raja bhi rank ho jaaye..
[02:10.26]shabda na koi kaam aaye.. swatantrata ke bhram humne phasaaye..
[02:17.45]Vaakya mook bas paisa royen.. jane kon ab paar lagaye..
[02:24.64]Mantra tabhi ek kaam men aaye..
[02:31.83]rupya aadam ki sirf jaroorat..
[02:39.03]jane kyon itna sabko bhaaye..
[02:46.22]Aray is bikaawali mein..
[02:53.41]Kitne chhupe hain raaj!
